not be played\nWatch: Endangered orangutans released back into the wild after Borneo fires\nClose\nEight orangutans have been released into the wild in Borneo after being rescued from intense wildfires.\nThree mothers, their three daughters and two adult males were freed in a reserve in the west of the island on Friday.\nIndonesian wildlife authorities rescued 46 of the apes, which are critically endangered, before fires tore through their habitat in August and September.\nRead more on this story.\nSubsection\nAsia\nPublished\n50 minutes ago\nShare\nclose panel\nShare page\nCopy link\nAbout sharing\nRelated topics\nIndonesia\nFollow\nIndonesia\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nIndonesia\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in\nMy News\nand in a collection on the\nNews homepage\n.\nOrangutans\nFollow\nOrangutans\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nOrangutans\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in\nMy News\nand in a collection on the\nNews homepage\n.\nBorneo\nFollow\nBorneo\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nBorneo\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in\nMy News\nand in a collection on the\nNews homepage\n.\nConservation\nFollow\nConservation\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nConservation\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in\nMy News\nand in a collection on the\nNews homepage\n.\nWildfires\nFollow\nWildfires\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nWildfires\nUpdates from your News topics will appear in\nMy News\nand in a collection on the\nNews homepage\n.\nRead description", "fetched_at": "2026-10-12T00:42:52.124893", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "インドネシア", "s": 0.163, "e": 0.812, "sm": 162, "em": 812, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "領", "s": 0.825, "e": 1.062, "sm": 825, "em": 1062, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "ボルネオ", "s": 1.075, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1075, "em": 1549, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "島", "s": 1.562, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1562, "em": 1775, "cs": 11, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "の", "s